<div class="container">
  <h1 class="mb-4">About Winnipeg Explorer</h1>

  <div class="card shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>Discover Winnipeg</h3>

      <p>
        Winnipeg Explorer is a web application designed to help
        people discover interesting places in Winnipeg, Manitoba.
      </p>

      <p>
        Visitors can explore parks, museums, landmarks and other
        attractions. Each attraction includes information such as
        its description, address, category and entry fee.
      </p>

      <h4 class="mt-4">Project Features</h4>

      <ul>
        <li>Browse Winnipeg attractions.</li>
        <li>View individual attraction details.</li>
        <li>Explore attractions by category.</li>
        <li>View attraction addresses and coordinates.</li>
      </ul>

      <%= link_to "Explore Attractions",
          attractions_path,
          class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>